    m_Localized: New promotional offers are available from the Underground Exchange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892928
    m_Localized: Wild has referred a buying customer to the Store for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892929
    m_Localized: Wild has referred a selling customer to the Store for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892930
    m_Localized: Wild has referred a high-budget contraband buyer to the Store for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892931
    m_Localized: Your Security informant has sent word that your Store will be inspected in 2 days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892932
    m_Localized: Your Security informant has sent word that an inspection is scheduled for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892933
    m_Localized: Your Security informant has sent word that an inspection is imminent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892934
    m_Localized: 'One of your contacts has informed you that a wanted criminal: {0}, visited the Store yesterday.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892935
    m_Localized: You are doing well on cash and should consider investing your money into upgrades or expanding your contacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892936
    m_Localized: Due to high levels of contraband trading, Security is running possible sting operations against you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892937
    m_Localized: An active Security investigation against you is almost complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892938
    m_Localized: You open up the store late due to last night's activities and missed out on one customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892939
    m_Localized: Wild's Fixer went out to silence witnesses and remove evidence tonight. Your suspected crime level has decreased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892940
    m_Localized: The storefront was not cleaned last night, {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892941
    m_Localized: The storefront has been cleaned and garbage has been collected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892942
    m_Localized: The Janitorial Service has cleaned up the mess caused by recent vandalism. Customers should feel safe again to visit the Store now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892943
    m_Localized: but there was nothing to clean anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892944
    m_Localized: there are garbage bags in front of the store, a few customers may be deterred from visiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830336892945
    m_Localized: there's so much garbage and junk left in front of the store, that it is deterring potential customers from visiting the Store!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087232
    m_Localized: it's a complete mess! There's so much garbage and rubble that it's hard to even approach the store, even for those who want to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087233
    m_Localized: The power has been cut off due to an unpaid power bill. Your dim emergency light flicks on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087234
    m_Localized: The power bill has been paid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087235
    m_Localized: The Cartel is protecting the Store. Thieves wouldn't dare try to rob you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087236
    m_Localized: You aren't currently covered by the insurance service. It has been {0} days since you were last covered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087237
    m_Localized: The insurance service has been paid, you are covered!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087238
    m_Localized: There's been a break in! Luckily, the security alarm was triggered and the thief left empty handed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087239
    m_Localized: There was a burglary last night! What the hell?! The security alarm failed! {0} was stolen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087240
    m_Localized: You've been robbed! {0} was stolen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087241
    m_Localized: There was a burglary. {0} was stolen, but Joe Wild's men found the thief and brought back the stolen item in the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087242
    m_Localized: Your store has been vandalized by angry Lower Level customers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087243
    m_Localized: Your store has been vandalized by Security sympathizers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087244
    m_Localized: Your Store has been vandalized by thugs hired by Upper Level customers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087245
    m_Localized: Your Store has been vandalized by Revolution sympathizers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087246
    m_Localized: Your Store has been vandalized by the Cartel as a threat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087247
    m_Localized: Your Store has been vandalized by angry customers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087248
    m_Localized: Your Store has been vandalized! Customers are less likely to visit, and it will cost significantly more to clean up the mess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087249
    m_Localized: Due to your Reputation, a faction has shared the date of an upcoming operation with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087250
    m_Localized: Your contact, {0}, is now ready to take on a new order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087251
    m_Localized: There's a blackout, but thanks to the Power Hijack, you still have power!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087252
    m_Localized: There's a blackout. The power is out! Your dim emergency light flicks on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087253
    m_Localized: Incident Report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087254
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits has been added to your account. Security has captured {1} thanks to your assistance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087255
    m_Localized: '<i>Your Reputation with Security has improved.</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087256
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits has been added to your account. Security has captured a contraband dealer thanks to your assistance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087257
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits has been added to your account. Security has captured a thief thanks to your assistance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087258
    m_Localized: '<i>Your Reputation with Security has slightly improved.</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087259
    m_Localized: "\n<i>Your reputation with {0} has degraded.</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 916830341087260
    m_Localized: ' You have made a wrongful report to Security. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
