  - m_Id: 951840624394240
    m_Localized: Rent Due
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171456
    m_Localized: Mortgage Payment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171457
    m_Localized: Cartel Visit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171458
    m_Localized: Gang war In The Lower Levels!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171459
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Gang War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171460
    m_Localized: Rival gangs has declared war on each other! Shootouts and skirmishes have erupted across the Lower Levels. Expect increased demand for Medical Supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171461
    m_Localized: Illegal Weapon Shipment Arrives!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171462
    m_Localized: Illegal Weapon Shipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171463
    m_Localized: A large shipment of illegal weapons has slipped past Security patrols and entered the Lower Levels. Expect a surge in weapon availability and drop in prices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171464
    m_Localized: Increased Weapons Demand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171465
    m_Localized: Reports indicate a minor surge in demands for weapons from secret buyers all over the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171466
    m_Localized: Revolution Mobilization
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171467
    m_Localized: Major revolution activities have been detected in the Lower Levels. Revolution cells are making final preparations for a major operation. Expected Weapon, Medical Supplies and Armor prices to surge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171468
    m_Localized: Revolution Raid on Upper Level!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171469
    m_Localized: Revolution Raid on Upper Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171470
    m_Localized: Revolutionaries have launched daring raids in the Upper Levels. Looting goods from homes and businesses to sell in the Lower Levels to fund their operations. Expected increase supply for Household Goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171471
    m_Localized: Revolution Raid on Security!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171472
    m_Localized: Revolution Raid on Security
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171473
    m_Localized: Revolutionaries have ambushed a major Lower Levels Security outpost. The clashes have led to losses on both sides along with Lower Levels Citizens caught in the crossfire, driving up demand for medical supplies and weakening Security influence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171474
    m_Localized: Security Patrols Intensified!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171475
    m_Localized: Increased Patrols & Checkpoints
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171476
    m_Localized: Security has temporarily expanded patrols and set up new checkpoints across the Lower Levels. Some Revolutionary and Black Market activities are suppressed, bringing back some order in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171477
    m_Localized: Station-wide Crackdown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171478
    m_Localized: In response to growing concerns over the rise in black market activity and the influx of illegal goods across the station, Command has announced a comprehensive crackdown on contraband. Effective immediately, the enforcement of stricter inspections will be implemented across all sectors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171479
    m_Localized: Black Market Raid!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171480
    m_Localized: Security Raid on Black Market
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171481
    m_Localized: Security forces launched a surprise raid on black market hubs. Large amount of weapon and narcotic were seized, disrupting illegal trade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171482
    m_Localized: Revolution Hideout Busted!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171483
    m_Localized: Raid on Revolutionaries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171484
    m_Localized: Security has raided a uncovered revolutionary safehouse. The arrests and confiscations has weaken the revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171485
    m_Localized: Martial Law Declared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171486
    m_Localized: Martial Law
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171487
    m_Localized: Due to recent events, Martial law has been declared across the Lower Levels. Curfews, checkpoints, and surveillance blanket the district. Revolutionary and Black Market activities are suppressed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171488
    m_Localized: Security Budget Increase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171489
    m_Localized: Command allocates a major budget increase to Security, allowing additional operations to be launched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171490
    m_Localized: Riots Break Out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171491
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Riot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171492
    m_Localized: Due to recent event, crowds of Lower Levels citizens erupt into violent riots across the Lower Levels. Shops are looted, Security outposts attacked, and chaos spreads quickly. Food and Weapon are in high demands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171493
    m_Localized: Workers on Strike!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171494
    m_Localized: Worker Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171495
    m_Localized: Due to recent events, disgruntled Lower Level workers have gone on strike. Food and water supplies are being disrupted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171496
    m_Localized: Medical Aid Distributed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171497
    m_Localized: Emergency Medical Aid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171498
    m_Localized: Upper Level charities have gather additional medical staff and supplies to the Lower Levels. While some residents remain skeptical, the effort reduces unrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171499
    m_Localized: Food Aid Distributed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171500
    m_Localized: Food Drive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171501
    m_Localized: In a rare gesture of goodwill, Command has distributed rations and food packages across Lower Levels neighborhoods. The initiative eases tensions but some view it as a propaganda tactic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171502
    m_Localized: Household Aid Distributed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171503
    m_Localized: Household Relief Drive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171504
    m_Localized: A charity in the Upper Levels has made a generous donation of essential Household Goods to Lower Levels residents. While some remain skeptical of the motives, the aid should helps improve living conditions and settle any growing unrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171505
    m_Localized: Lottery Draw!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171506
    m_Localized: Lottery Draw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840641171507
    m_Localized: '{0} is the winning number! Redeem your ticket with your lottery representative! If you have at least 3 matching digits, you win a prize! Good Luck!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365760
    m_Localized: Lower Level Revolutionary Captured!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365761
    m_Localized: In a swift operation by station security, Arthur Lafleur, a known activist and part of the former leadership in the failed revolution attempts of the lower levels, has been apprehended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365762
    m_Localized: Evidence Locker Break-In!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365763
    m_Localized: A daring break-in at the Station's Central Evidence Locker has left Security scrambling. Reports indicate that a crate of confiscated contraband, including key evidence in an active investigation, has gone missing. Security have warned the citizens of the Lower Levels to keep an eye out for suspicious goods entering circulation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365764
    m_Localized: All Quiet In The Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365765
    m_Localized: The Lower Levels have been unusually quiet today, with no major incidents to report. Markets are stable and residents are going about their daily lives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365766
    m_Localized: Scheduled Electrical Maintenance Work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365767
    m_Localized: The Upper Levels will experience a temporary blackout as planned electrical maintenance work gets underway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365768
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit For All!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365769
    m_Localized: A collective of Lower Levels maintenance technicians have developed a low-cost hydroponic system capable of producing small but consistent batches of Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365770
    m_Localized: How Much Meat Is Actually In PEAT?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365771
    m_Localized: PEAT, the canned processed meat found in nearly every kitchen in the Lower Levels, is under scrutiny. Independent researchers are questioning how much of the product is actually meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365772
    m_Localized: Recycling Awareness Campaign Launched
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365773
    m_Localized: A small recycling awareness campaign has been launched on the mid-levels to encourage proper waste disposal. The campaign is expected to have minimal practical impact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365774
    m_Localized: Local Artist Showcase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365775
    m_Localized: A local artist showcase is being hosted in the Lower Levels, where residents can view and purchase artwork made from recycled station materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365776
    m_Localized: Brief Maintenance Crew Strike Ends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365777
    m_Localized: A brief strike by maintenance crews has been resolved with no significant delays or damages reported. Normal operations have resumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365778
    m_Localized: A Glimpse At The Future!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365779
    m_Localized: A technology exhibition has been organized on the Upper Levels, showcasing the latest innovations from startups and tech companies. Most products on display are aimed at high-end buyers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365780
    m_Localized: New Transit Line Opens on Mid-Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365781
    m_Localized: A new transit line has opened on the mid-levels, connecting several residential districts to a commercial hub. The improved connectivity is expected to slightly ease commutes for mid-level residents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365782
    m_Localized: Decorative Water Fountain Unveiled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365783
    m_Localized: A new water fountain has been unveiled on the Upper Levels as part of an ongoing beautification project. Security has advised that any citizen caught drinking from the fountain will be arrested and fined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365784
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Community Garden Expanded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365785
    m_Localized: Lower Level residents have expanded their community garden with a few new plots for growing basic vegetables. The development is unlikely to affect Food prices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365786
    m_Localized: Mid-Level Art Contest Held
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365787
    m_Localized: An art contest held in a mid-level community center invited residents to submit their creations, with the best entries to be displayed in public spaces for a week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365788
    m_Localized: Cultural Celebration in Upper Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365789
    m_Localized: An Upper Level cultural group is holding a small celebration featuring traditional performances, music, and food. The event will be mostly attended by Upper Level residents and have little impact on the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365790
    m_Localized: Routine Spacewalk Training Exercise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365791
    m_Localized: A routine spacewalk training exercise for station technicians has been successfully completed with no disruptions to station activities. One man from the Lower Levels is reportedly being treated for shock, after mistaking a spacewalker for an alien.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365792
    m_Localized: Massive Nutrifruit Farm Harvest Season
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365793
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit Harvest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365794
    m_Localized: A large Mid-Level farm is harvesting its Nutrifruit crop. Expect fresh Nutrifruit and lower Food prices for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365795
    m_Localized: Poor Nutrifruit Harvest Devastates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365796
    m_Localized: Bad Nutrifruit Harvest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365797
    m_Localized: A Lower Level Nutrifruit farm has had a terrible season, with crops failing due to lack of proper resources and maintenance. Expect higher Food prices and a shortage of fresh produce for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365798
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit Seed Heist!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365799
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit Seed Shortage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365800
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit seeds from hydroponic farm storage have vanished overnight in a daring theft. Both Food and Seed costs are expected to rise sharply across the station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365801
    m_Localized: Counterfeit Medical Supplies Discovered!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365802
    m_Localized: Medical Supplies Shortage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365803
    m_Localized: A large quantity of counterfeit medical goods have been discovered across various clinics and hospitals. Demand for genuine medical supplies is expected to surge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365804
    m_Localized: Breakdown At Treatment Plant Threatens Water Supply
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365805
    m_Localized: Water Supply Crisis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365806
    m_Localized: A pump failure at the central Water Treatment Plant is causing major disruption to the water supply. Security has appealed for calm, as market experts anticipate prices for Water and Water Purification Supplies to soar over the next few days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365807
    m_Localized: Scheduled Maintenance To Proceed At Water Treatment Plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365808
    m_Localized: Minor Water Shortage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365809
    m_Localized: Routine maintenance at the central Water Treatment Plant will proceed on schedule, Security has announced. Disruptions to the pipeline are expected to be limited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365810
    m_Localized: Miners Return from Ice Asteroid!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365811
    m_Localized: Water Supply Surplus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365812
    m_Localized: One of our brave mining crews have returned from a successful expedition to the ice-rich asteroid known as "Beira 41-A". Their return is expected to result in an influx of High Quality Water, and lower prices as a result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365813
    m_Localized: Mob Justice in the Lower Levels!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365814
    m_Localized: Lower Level Lynching
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365815
    m_Localized: Fed up with a dishonest shopkeeper, citizens in the Lower Levels are taking justice into their own hands. Station Security have appealed for calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365816
    m_Localized: Hidden Storeroom Excavated!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365817
    m_Localized: Household Item Surplus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365818
    m_Localized: A group of scavengers in the Lower Levels have stumbled upon a hidden room packed with household items. A high volume of goods making their way to market will likely lower prices today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365819
    m_Localized: Mining Expedition Returns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365820
    m_Localized: Material Surplus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365821
    m_Localized: A cohort of miners have returned from an expedition to a mineral-rich asteroid. Material prices are expected to fall for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365822
    m_Localized: Construction Projects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365823
    m_Localized: Various new construction projects are springing up across the Lower Levels. Construction materials and skilled labourers are likely to be in shorter supply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365824
    m_Localized: Meteor Shower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365825
    m_Localized: A meteor shower struck the station last night, causing damage and breaches across multiple sectors. The Lower Levels, lacking a reinforced hull, suffered the most — expect material prices to rise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365826
    m_Localized: Low Power In The Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365827
    m_Localized: Power Outage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365828
    m_Localized: A faulty power generator has caused a power outage in the Lower Levels. Expect a shortage of energy cells while repairs are underway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365829
    m_Localized: Scheduled Power Plant Maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365830
    m_Localized: Power Plant Maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365831
    m_Localized: Routine maintenance has begun on one of the main power plants in the Lower Levels. Citizens have been told to expect minor disruptions to the power supply throughout the scheduled period.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365832
    m_Localized: Who Turned Out The Lights?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365833
    m_Localized: A catastrophic failure in the central power grid has plunged the entire Station into darkness. Expect a surge in demand for energy cells and power-related products.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365834
    m_Localized: Which Way To The Pool?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365835
    m_Localized: Tourist Influx
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365836
    m_Localized: A cruise ship has docked in the Upper Levels, unloading a wave of tourists. It is expected that some curious visitors may even wander down to the Lower Levels. Station Security has appealed for citizens to be respectful during the visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365837
    m_Localized: Oxymore Addiction On The Rise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951840645365838
    m_Localized: A sharp increase in Oxymore use has been reported across the Station, with clinics seeing a surge in addiction and overdose cases. Expect rising demand for medical supplies and treatment services.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
