  - m_Id: 1081528126586880
    m_Localized: These cigarettes are counterfeit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586881
    m_Localized: There's an issue with the {0}. You see?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586882
    m_Localized: lettering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586883
    m_Localized: color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586884
    m_Localized: seal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586885
    m_Localized: logo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586886
    m_Localized: box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586887
    m_Localized: Ah yes, I see it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586888
    m_Localized: I will lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586889
    m_Localized: Check again, there is nothing wrong with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586891
    m_Localized: Ah, Georgio didn't know about this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586892
    m_Localized: Georgio will lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586893
    m_Localized: Everything is wrong with these cigarettes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586894
    m_Localized: Ok, ok.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586895
    m_Localized: This is actually genuine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586896
    m_Localized: Really? Thanks for telling me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081528126586897
    m_Localized: No, it is not. I checked it myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
