  - m_Id: 1269254276825088
    m_Localized: You Defaulted On Your Rent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796608
    m_Localized: As a result of failing to pay your rent, you were evicted. Abandoned by your customers, your contact, and even The Mentor, you are forced to go back to the life of a scavenger. It isn't long before the Store is rented out to somebody new, and you find yourself standing on the other side of the counter, haggling for just a few credits more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796609
    m_Localized: Arrested
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796610
    m_Localized: For crimes against the station, the Security arrested you. You were locked up in the brig. While serving your sentence, your store was leased to someone else. After your release, with the store lost, you went back to the life of a struggling scavenger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796611
    m_Localized: Executed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796612
    m_Localized: For capital crimes against the station, the Security arrested and executed you. After your execution your store was leased to someone else. Your customers quickly forgot about you, and in time, there was no trace of you left on the Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796613
    m_Localized: Buyout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796614
    m_Localized: You sign the deed, and with it, the weight of the rent vanishes, alongside the shadow of the Landlord. The shop is yours, free and clear, a hard-earned victory in a world that's never been kind. For the first time, you stand in control of your future, with nothing but your own ambition to guide you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796615
    m_Localized: You sign the final papers, and with it, the last chains that bound you to the loan shark are broken. The store is truly yours now, free from the threat of repossession, free from the shadow of the underworld. You've beaten the odds, survived the grind, and come out on top. The future is yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796616
    m_Localized: Repossession
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796617
    m_Localized: It's the end of the road. The store is taken from you, and with it, everything you fought for slips through your fingers. The loan shark's cold grip tightens as the walls close in, leaving you bankrupt, homeless, and with nothing but a bitter reminder of how quickly everything can be lost in this unforgiving world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796618
    m_Localized: Lynched
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796619
    m_Localized: After one too many offences against the Lower Levels, a mob of angry customers stormed your store. They took everything you owned and you were thrown out of the airlock. This is justice in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796620
    m_Localized: Framed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796621
    m_Localized: Arrested by the Security on some trumped up charges, you were thrown in the brig. The store was seized and sold to pay for a large fine. You were released after a few weeks, but the store was long gone. You went back to the life of a struggling scavenger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796622
    m_Localized: Assassinated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796623
    m_Localized: After one too many offences against the Upper Levels, a hitman was contracted by the elites of the station to take you out for good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796624
    m_Localized: Sentinel Collapse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796625
    m_Localized: After skipping one too many Immunivax injectors, your faulty immune system turned on your own body. It wasn't an illness that killed you, it was yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796626
    m_Localized: Bombed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796627
    m_Localized: After being declared as an enemy of the Revolution, a bomb was planted in your store. The explosion destroyed the store and killed you. The ruin of your store served as a warning to others who would dare to oppose the Revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796628
    m_Localized: Retired
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796629
    m_Localized: The Cartel decided that you were no longer worth keeping around. You were retired from the business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796630
    m_Localized: No Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796631
    m_Localized: You weren't able to secure a vendor permit and were forced to close your store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269254297796632
