  - m_Id: 1281055945179136
    m_Localized: The water line is currently connected to the industrial discharge pipe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179137
    m_Localized: Critical Repair In Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179138
    m_Localized: The meteor shower breached a number of areas in the Lower Levels. We have closed down adjacent areas and started repairs on the breaches, but progress has been slow due to lack of supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179139
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Engineers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179140
    m_Localized: Pool Repair In Upper Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179141
    m_Localized: The Upper Levels Community pool was damaged during the meteor shower. It was due for renovation anyway. We are interested in buying a crate of engineering supplies to speed up the process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179142
    m_Localized: Upper Levels Community Manager
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179143
    m_Localized: Medical Supply For Lower Levels Charity Clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179144
    m_Localized: We are out of medical supplies. Shortages have left many without proper treatment. Any help would be greatly appreciated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179145
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Charity Clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179146
    m_Localized: Medical Supply For Upper Levels General Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179147
    m_Localized: We are experiencing delays in receiving critical medical supplies. While we still have stock, we are willing to pay a premium to ensure our reserves remain well-stocked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179148
    m_Localized: Upper Levels General Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179149
    m_Localized: Medical Supply For Black Market
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179150
    m_Localized: With the ongoing shortage, we are buying up all the supply to drive up the price even higher! Get us the supply and we will pay you handsomely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179151
    m_Localized: Shady Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179152
    m_Localized: Materials for Lower Level Construction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179153
    m_Localized: A new housing block is under construction in the Lower Levels, but securing materials has been a challenge. We need supplies to keep the project moving forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179154
    m_Localized: Lower Level Construction Crew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179155
    m_Localized: Construction Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179156
    m_Localized: The demand for construction materials is rising, and we intend to make sure we control the supply. Get us the supplies before the others do and we'll pay well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179157
    m_Localized: Shady Broker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179158
    m_Localized: Supplies for Lower Level Soup Kitchen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179159
    m_Localized: The recent events have left many in need. We can't pay much, but we will make sure to let everyone know of your kindness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179160
    m_Localized: Soup Kitchen Coordinator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179161
    m_Localized: Missing Evidence Locker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179162
    m_Localized: A crate of important evidence has gone missing. We need it back ASAP, no questions asked. Deliver it quickly, and you'll be compensated accordingly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179163
    m_Localized: Head of Security for Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179164
    m_Localized: Stolen Evidence Locker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179165
    m_Localized: A recently stolen crate of evidence contains damaging information against my client. We are willing to pay a premium to secure it before it falls back into Security's hands or worse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179166
    m_Localized: Unknown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
