    m_Localized: Kim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179179
    m_Localized: Refreshment Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179180
    m_Localized: Need some refreshment for our friend's birthday party. It's last-minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179181
    m_Localized: Refreshment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179182
    m_Localized: Scrap Metal Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179183
    m_Localized: We need scrap metal to build a new garden. The old one's decrepit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179184
    m_Localized: Housewarming Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179185
    m_Localized: We need a housewarming gift for an upcoming friend's gathering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179186
    m_Localized: Housewarming Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179187
    m_Localized: Processed Meat Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179188
    m_Localized: We are stocking up our garden for a picnic and need non-perishables. Processed meat is ideal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179189
    m_Localized: One of our clients has requested this. We will pay well for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179190
    m_Localized: Upper Level Representative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179191
    m_Localized: We are collecting items for charity to help those in need in the Lower Levels. Any contribution would be greatly appreciated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179192
    m_Localized: Upper Level Charity Organizer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179193
    m_Localized: Worker's Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179194
    m_Localized: Need something to survive those long shifts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179195
    m_Localized: Lower Level Worker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179196
    m_Localized: Toilet Paper for Georgio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179197
    m_Localized: Georgio needs toilet paper for his collection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179198
    m_Localized: Georgio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179199
    m_Localized: Meat Cleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179200
    m_Localized: Need a new cleaver. Old one is dull.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179201
    m_Localized: Anonymous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179202
    m_Localized: Beer for Janitor Crew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179203
    m_Localized: My crew's been grinding hard. Time to kick back. Get me some Red Imp Beers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179204
    m_Localized: Sawyer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179205
    m_Localized: Li-Eat Snack Bars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179206
    m_Localized: My favorite snack bar is sold out everywhere. Get me a couple. I'll pay well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179207
    m_Localized: Officer Lun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
