    m_Localized: Crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179209
    m_Localized: Someone has been doing their own cleaning without our permission. We will make an example out of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179210
    m_Localized: Energy Drinks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179211
    m_Localized: Need some energy drinks to stay awake. Gotta finish my experiments!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179212
    m_Localized: Dr. Jackson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179213
    m_Localized: Landlord's Special
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179214
    m_Localized: One of my tenants keeps asking me to repair his door. Just get me some scrap metal and I'll see what I can do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179215
    m_Localized: The Landlord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179216
    m_Localized: Landlord's Special 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179217
    m_Localized: An annoying tenant keeps asking me to repair their ventilation. I guess I'll just increase the rent more next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179218
    m_Localized: Landlord's Special 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179219
    m_Localized: One of my unit's street windows got broken. I'll just patch it up with some cloth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179220
    m_Localized: Retirement BBQ Party
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179221
    m_Localized: We are pitching in to get Officer Boucher a nice BBQ party for his retirement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179222
    m_Localized: Pet Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179223
    m_Localized: Acquire some real raw meat, fresh and unprocessed. Only the best for my pet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179224
    m_Localized: Upper Level Elite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179225
    m_Localized: Baby Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179226
    m_Localized: I can't believe that Galaxy Blend is the only decent food nutritious enough for a baby around the Lower Levels. Help me get some.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1281055945179227
    m_Localized: Lower Level Mother
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355192635392
    m_Localized: Huh... The water purity is actually higher!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995520
    m_Localized: Wow, thanks for letting me know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995521
    m_Localized: This is Rustwater. I can see the particles in the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995522
    m_Localized: So? Fine, I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995523
    m_Localized: This is clearly Gutterflow. It's brown, see?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995524
    m_Localized: Alright, I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995525
    m_Localized: This is Ghostwater. It's hard to tell, can't be too careful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995526
    m_Localized: Really? I'll lower the price, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355221995527
    m_Localized: This is Basewater. Are you trying to pull a fast one or what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189824
    m_Localized: This isn't the right purity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189825
    m_Localized: Ok, I'll adjust the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189826
    m_Localized: I don't have the Credits for Pure Water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189827
    m_Localized: I can't afford High-Quality Water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189828
    m_Localized: Basewater? I'm not drinking that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189829
    m_Localized: I am not drinking Ghostwater...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189830
    m_Localized: Are you crazy? I'm not drinking Rustwater!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189831
    m_Localized: Wow, you expect me to drink that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189832
    m_Localized: Yeah... I'm not drinking that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189833
    m_Localized: That can't be right,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189834
    m_Localized: It's way too high.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189835
    m_Localized: It's way too low.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189836
    m_Localized: You clearly don't know what you are doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189837
    m_Localized: I'm out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652355226189838
    m_Localized: '{0} Appraisal'
