    m_Localized: '[Fully Repaired]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526535
    m_Localized: Stop selling that bogus water, you are killing us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526536
    m_Localized: We know what you did. Stop the water scam, NOW!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526537
    m_Localized: Keep on selling tainted water, and you'll regret it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526538
    m_Localized: How do you sleep when you are selling Ghostwater as drinking water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526539
    m_Localized: Stop the Ghostwater scam, or we'll stop you ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526540
    m_Localized: Your fake water is killing us. You're next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526541
    m_Localized: Your ammo almost got me killed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526542
    m_Localized: Every day I pass by your shop... one day I'll have the courage to say hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526543
    m_Localized: You don't know me, but I know everything about you. Keep being you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526544
    m_Localized: I left something for you. Just a small token of... appreciation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526545
    m_Localized: 'I wonder if you ever notice me watching from the shadows... '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526546
    m_Localized: You make the Lower Levels feel a little brighter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526547
    m_Localized: You're the only reason I come here anymore. Stay safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10118164533526548
    m_Localized: To my favorite shopkeeper, don't forget to smile today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
