      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084774883328
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't do any harm at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437760
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't finish the job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437761
    m_Localized: My target is still alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437762
    m_Localized: And it made him high!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437763
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me almost killed me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437764
    m_Localized: What the hell man?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437765
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold to my friend killed him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437766
    m_Localized: You are going to pay for this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437767
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't work!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437768
    m_Localized: I am pregnant now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437769
    m_Localized: Now she is pregnant!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437770
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't work!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437771
    m_Localized: I still have my addictions!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437772
    m_Localized: And also it made me high!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437773
    m_Localized: I saved up a lot of credit for that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437774
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't do anything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437775
    m_Localized: Did you even put any actual drugs in it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437776
    m_Localized: I didn't get high at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437777
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me was so weak!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437778
    m_Localized: I barely felt anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437779
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me didn't work very well!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437780
    m_Localized: It was pretty weak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437781
    m_Localized: It also made me feel weird...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084808437782
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me felt a bit off. I can't quite put my finger on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084816826368
    m_Localized: The <b>{0}</b> you sold me was a scam!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45243084816826369
    m_Localized: The purity was way off from what you promised!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
