      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825988
    m_Localized: "- Add Reducing Agent equal to the Dream Cap Extract\n- Add Lipobond Agent equal to a quarter of it\n- Heat the mixture to 45-55C to get Nomore"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825989
    m_Localized: 'WARNING: DREAM CAP EXTRACT WILL DEGRADE ABOVE 60C'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825990
    m_Localized: 'Step 5: Packaging'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825991
    m_Localized: "- Filter again and evaporate the Lipobond Agent\n- Select Nomore Injector in the Chem Finisher"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825992
    m_Localized: Your store has been vandalized. Someone wrote "MEAT" across the front... in blood!?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825993
    m_Localized: You'd better get yourself a gun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825994
    m_Localized: I'm patient. I'll be waiting the moment you step outside your store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825995
    m_Localized: Sooner or later, you'll have to come out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825996
    m_Localized: You need to bring a gun with you, otherwise {0} will kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825997
    m_Localized: You feel an uneasy presence watching you. Good thing you brought a gun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825998
    m_Localized: Butcher Hunting Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510825999
    m_Localized: Sawyer's crew paid {0} a visit last night. He will not be selling anyone's fresh meat again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87694833510826000
    m_Localized: Lou told you not to touch her toys. She left another little present on your counter, and this one was real. The explosion destroyed the store and killed you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87729210584252416
    m_Localized: The Liquid Luck wears off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413656555520
    m_Localized: That should be enough food for Serpico.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498560
    m_Localized: You left {0} kcal of food for Serpico at the Dumping Ground ({1} / {2} kcal).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498561
    m_Localized: This is Serpico. I got shot while trying to escape. I'm at the Dumping Ground now. A kind scavenger patched me up and agreed to drop this letter off to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498562
    m_Localized: I grabbed some incriminating evidence before I left. I need some time to organize everything, but I'm not gonna make it without food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498563
    m_Localized: I have a big favor to ask you. Can you drop off {0} kcal worth of food at the Dumping Ground? Just leave it on the ground. I'll pick it up when no one's around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498564
    m_Localized: I don't think I'll last more than {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498565
    m_Localized: Security Officer Found Dead in the Dumping Ground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498566
    m_Localized: Cadet Serpico, who was under investigation on corruption charges, was found dead in the Dumping Ground. The Security Department has given no further details at this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498567
    m_Localized: Security Corruption Exposed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498568
    m_Localized: Documents exposing corruption inside Station Security have been published across the station. Several low-ranking officers now face criminal charges. No high-ranking officer has faced any consequence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498569
    m_Localized: Corruption Charges Reach Security Leadership
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498570
    m_Localized: Evidence handed to a senior officer has led to criminal charges against Security officers of every rank. A new anti-corruption task force has been formed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498571
    m_Localized: 'You couldn''t pay what you owed Lou, so she settled the score her own way: a little present on your counter, and this one was real. The explosion destroyed the store and killed you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498572
    m_Localized: High-Ranking Visiting Admiral Assassinated!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88074413698498573
    m_Localized: A visiting Republic admiral and his escort were gunned down near the docking bays last night. Witnesses say the shooter, a blonde woman in a stolen Security uniform, walked right up to the admiral's party before opening fire. Officers on the scene hit her several times, but she escaped, and no trace of her has been found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88101797344624640
    m_Localized: 'Tickets scratched: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88101797344624641
    m_Localized: 'Average winnings: {0} credits'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88101797344624642
    m_Localized: Your store was vandalized overnight. "JOHN SMITH" is spray-painted across the front in huge letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
