  - m_Id: 88314022701350916
    m_Localized: pastel's Nutrifruit Secret Leaked!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350917
    m_Localized: A research paper has been published showing how to make standard Nutrifruit grow seeds again. Biohackers across the station are already growing the new strain, and seed prices have collapsed. The same morning, the former director of the station's largest hydroponics farm, jailed for embezzlement, was found dead in her cell. pastel has declined to comment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
