  - m_Id: 90521366424240128
    m_Localized: 'The food buys Serpico one more day. Nights left to bring the rest: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90521366449405952
    m_Localized: Georgio left a crate of Nutrifruits for Serpico at the Dumping Ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90934939390533632
    m_Localized: 'The security alarm did not arm: its cell cannot supply the {0} kJ it draws per night.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522599710720
    m_Localized: Your body carries some lasting damage from the disorder. It is not dangerous yet, but it will not go away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070848
    m_Localized: Your body cannot take another missed injection. One more late injection will kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070849
    m_Localized: INSUFFICIENT ENERGY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070850
    m_Localized: Color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070851
    m_Localized: Configure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070852
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits has been added to your account. {1} was neutralized at your counter and logged as a capture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070853
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit. That stung. I'm not mad, I'm IMPRESSED. But a girl has expenses. Fill this locker with {0} Credits' worth of goods and leave it on your front counter when you close. You have {1} nights. The night after that, the whole store goes boom. Kisses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070854
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit! You came through. I knew you had it in you. A little something for the shop. Kisses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070855
    m_Localized: Shootout in the Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91360522629070856
    m_Localized: Residents of the Lower Levels reported sustained gunfire from an abandoned warehouse in the old freight district last night. Security found the building rigged with tripwires and, inside, the bodies of several heavily armed individuals in plain clothes, none carrying station identification. Nobody has come forward to claim them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92020230687866880
    m_Localized: '{0} / {1} Credits'' worth Lou asked for.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92020230721421312
    m_Localized: 'Nights left: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93331566923399168
    m_Localized: 'Nutrifruit. Lost my locker already? Sloppy. Here''s another one, same deal: {0} Credits'' worth of goods, on your front counter when you close, {1} nights. There won''t be a third. Kisses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
